        <h1 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ypsilanti-township-domestic-violence.astro:fzckkm">Ypsilanti Township Domestic Violence Defense Atty Joe Simon</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ypsilanti-township-domestic-violence.astro:5m0nmr">Successfully Defending Ypsilanti Township Domestic Violence Cases For Over 35 Years</p>
        <p class="hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ypsilanti-township-domestic-violence.astro:5m0nms">Ypsi Twp Domestic Violence Defense Attorney Joe Simon Named a Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney in Michigan by Leading Lawyers Magazine 2020 Peer-Review Poll.</p>
